{"1671570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Out and About", "steam_appid": 1671570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4533180], "detailed_description": "<h1>Official Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/7dd6c93aff9c46f47971070b6474bade.poster.avif?t=1785150087\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/7dd6c93aff9c46f47971070b6474bade.webm?t=1785150087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/7dd6c93aff9c46f47971070b6474bade.mp4?t=1785150087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>This game contains real-life knowledge of plants 🌱 🍄 recipes 🥘 and herbalism 🍵!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of nature to rebuild your home in Out and About, a cozy foraging adventure! A storm has blown through the town of Portobello. To help this little community get back on its feet, you’ll need to learn all about the wild surrounding landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn to identify 92+ real life plants and fungi</strong>! From plants to mushrooms and seaweeds, foraged from different biomes and across different seasons. Currently covering spring and summer plants - more plants will be added with the 1.0 release in Q4 2026.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671570/extras/f3ee26a9234463e7c5428b9c48eb3f51.poster.avif?t=1785150087\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\